{"method": "item/completed", "params": {"item": {"type": "commandExecution", "id": "exec-b5925b8d-c9dc-4ced-a3a9-cb6349e98609", "pluginId": null, "scriptPath": null, "command": "/bin/bash -lc 'tail -5 artifacts/sprint1/test-design/test-cases.v1.csv'", "cwd": "/workspace", "processId": "88464", "source": "unifiedExecStartup", "status": "completed", "commandActions": [{"type": "unknown", "command": "tail -5 artifacts/sprint1/test-design/test-cases.v1.csv"}], "aggregatedOutput": "\"TC027\",\"库存、运费与交付\",\"R05 · 渠道库存模式与共享真实库存\",\"模式切换和仓库解绑保护既有分配并重验未完成结账\",\"AC-05-8; AC-05-9; AC-05-10; FD03; BD05; I03\",\"P0\",\"有既有订单分配/履约/退货来源、有效及即将失效预留、未完成 checkout；切换可能扩大可售区域。\",\"1. 在详情页检查模式、仓库、顺序及旧模式配送要求并发起切换。\n2. 查看差异摘要、取消一次再确认；随后解绑仓库。\n3. 对旧订单履约/退货，对未完成 checkout 再报价、预留和完成，重复失败尝试。\",\"1. 未确认不切换；确认后新规则生效。\n2. 既有 Allocation/Fulfillment/Return 来源不改写。\n3. 未完成 checkout 按当前关系重验，失效预留只释放一次且失败不重复扣减。\"\n", "exitCode": 0, "durationMs": 0}, "threadId": "01a0bfb7-01f3-72c2-b872-82eade8ed25e", "turnId": "01a0bfcf-9702-7fc3-8d70-5ef57cdac979", "completedAtMs": 1789924635062}, "emittedAtMs": 1789924635067}
